          {
            "title": "Question: One indent",
            "id": 107740,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Por qué es útil agregar una declaración <code>if</code> dentro de una función?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nos permite cambiar el comportamiento de la función basado en una condición</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es lo mismo que agregar cualquier otra instrucción dentro de una función</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hace que nuestra función sea más pequeña y fácil de leer</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nos permite cambiar el comportamiento de la función basado en una condición.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dentro de una función, <code>if (score &gt; 50)</code> imprime <code>High</code>. Después del bloque if, imprime <code>Done</code>.</p><p>Llamas a la función con una puntuación de <code>40</code>. ¿Qué aparece?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Solo <code>Done</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>High</code> y después <code>Done</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ninguno de los mensajes.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Solo <code>Done</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Braces and spaces",
            "id": 107735,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Llama a la función con el valor (argumento) que mostrará <code>\"Passed!\"</code> en la consola.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGrade\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &lt;= \" /><text value=\"65\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Failed...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGrade(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"130\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"65\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Passed!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Llama a la función con una puntuación que llegue a la rama <code>Passed!</code>, no a la rama de suspenso.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGrade\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &lt;= \" /><text value=\"65\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Failed...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGrade(\" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"130\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"65\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Passed!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Indenting the entire block",
            "id": 107734,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica la declaración <code>if</code> de manera que ambos mensajes se impriman en la consola.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isLying\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Can you trust him?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (boolean === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;He's lying.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isLying(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Can you trust him?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"He's lying.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code> seguido de <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Code blocks",
            "id": 107733,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Llama a la función con el argumento que resultará en un precio descontado en un 10%.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"discountedPrice\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"cost\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt; \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt;= \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cost);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"discountedPrice(\" /><text value=\"800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"238\" endIndex=\"241\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"720\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>800</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Llama a la función con un coste del nivel de descuento del 10%, no del nivel sin descuento ni del 20%.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"discountedPrice\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"cost\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt; \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (cost &gt;= \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = cost * \" /><text value=\"0.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cost = cost - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cost);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"discountedPrice(\" /><text value=\"800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"238\" endIndex=\"241\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"720\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>800</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple instructions",
            "id": 107732,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la declaración condicional para gravar adecuadamente el salario pasado a la función <code>getTaxedSalary()</code> cuando es más de 2,500.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getTaxedSalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &gt; \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary - (salary * \" /><text value=\"0.15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salary;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = getTaxedSalary(\" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(income);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &gt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(salary &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2380\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>(salary &gt; 2500)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aplica impuestos solo cuando el valor recibido por <code>getTaxedSalary()</code> supere 2,500, no cuando lo supere el resultado posterior <code>income</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getTaxedSalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &gt; \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary - (salary * \" /><text value=\"0.15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" salary;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" income = getTaxedSalary(\" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(income);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(income &gt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(salary &lt; 2500)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(salary &gt;= 2500)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2380\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>(salary &gt; 2500)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Comparing one value",
            "id": 107878,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica la declaración condicional para aplicar un descuento para niños si es apropiado.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; year(s): children's discount applies!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6 year(s): children's discount applies!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>age</code> seguido de <code>&lt;=</code> y finalmente <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Haz que el descuento se aplique a la edad infantil pasada a la función, incluida la edad de 10 años.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; year(s): children's discount applies!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"11\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"applyChildrensDiscount\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6 year(s): children's discount applies!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>age</code> seguido de <code>&lt;=</code> y finalmente <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Comparing two values",
            "id": 107877,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Construye la condicional dentro de la declaración <code>if</code> para que coincida correctamente con la salida.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGreater\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a &gt;= b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(a + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is greater than or equal to &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + b);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGreater(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"14 is greater than or equal to 13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>(</code> seguido de <code>a</code> y luego <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la condición que muestra el mensaje cuando el primer número es mayor o igual que el segundo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkGreater\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a &gt;= b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(a + \" /><text value=\"&quot; is greater than or equal to &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + b);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkGreater(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"14 is greater than or equal to 13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>(</code> seguido de <code>a</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>b</code> y finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Greater value",
            "id": 107876,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica la declaración <code>if else</code> para completar la función.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkEquality\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a === b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers are equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers aren't equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkEquality(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if (a &gt;= b)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Numbers are equal\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>if (a === b)</code> seguido de <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la decisión de igualdad para que las entradas iguales usen el primer mensaje y las demás el segundo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkEquality\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"a, b\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (a === b) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers are equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers aren't equal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkEquality(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if (a &gt;= b)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if (a = b)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Numbers are equal\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>if (a === b)</code> seguido de <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple times",
            "id": 107875,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra <code>Logging in</code> en la consola llamando a la función con la contraseña correcta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkPassword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (pass === \" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logging in...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wrong password, try again.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkPassword(\" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"166\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option startIndex=\"177\" endIndex=\"178\" /><option startIndex=\"178\" endIndex=\"179\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pass\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;swordfish&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Logging in...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>checkPassword</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>\"party1999\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Llama a la función de contraseña existente con la contraseña guardada para que muestre <code>Logging in...</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"checkPassword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (pass === \" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logging in...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wrong password, try again.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"checkPassword(\" /><text value=\"&quot;party1999&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"166\" endIndex=\"177\" /><option startIndex=\"177\" endIndex=\"178\" /><option startIndex=\"178\" endIndex=\"179\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pass\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;swordfish&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;party1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Logging in...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>checkPassword</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>\"party1999\"</code>, <code>)</code> y finalmente <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of a function",
            "id": 107899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es el propósito de una declaración <code>return</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Para devolver un valor de una función</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Para mostrar un valor en la consola</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Para llamar a una función definida previamente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Para devolver un valor de una función.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una función ejecuta <code>console.log(price)</code> y después <code>return price - 5</code>.</p><p>Pasas <code>20</code>. ¿Qué valor recibe quien llama a la función?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>15</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>20</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tanto <code>20</code> como <code>15</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>15</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Nothing gets executed",
            "id": 107900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué sucede cuando se coloca una declaración de retorno antes de las instrucciones en una función y se llama a la función?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Las instrucciones después de la declaración de retorno no se ejecutan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Las instrucciones antes de la declaración de retorno no se ejecutan</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La función no es válida y no se ejecutará en absoluto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Las instrucciones después de la declaración de retorno no se ejecutan.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una función tiene <code>return result;</code> seguido de <code>console.log(result);</code>. Al ejecutarse, ¿qué ocurre con la línea de registro?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No se ejecuta porque la función ya ha devuelto el resultado.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Se ejecuta antes de devolver el valor.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hace que la función no sea válida.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No se ejecuta porque la función ya ha devuelto el resultado.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple return statements",
            "id": 107901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué declaración(es) de retorno se ejecuta(n) en este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseByTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Let's increase &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number + \" /><text value=\"&quot; by ten.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = increaseByTen(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La primera declaración de retorno</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La segunda declaración de retorno</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ambas declaraciones de retorno</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La primera declaración de retorno.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Intercambias las dos líneas <code>return</code> y mantienes la llamada sin cambios. ¿Qué valor se asigna ahora a <code>result</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"increaseByTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Let's increase &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number + \" /><text value=\"&quot; by ten.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = increaseByTen(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>39</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Let's increase 29 by ten.\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Se combinan ambos valores.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>39</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return in if statements",
            "id": 107909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra el mensaje <code>With honors</code> colocando las declaraciones de retorno en la posición correcta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasHonors\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"grade\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (grade &gt;= \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;With honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Without honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hasHonors(\" /><text value=\"98\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"With honors\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return \"With honors\";</code> seguido de <code>return \"Without honors\";</code> y finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Devuelve <code>With honors</code> para una nota que cumpla el requisito y devuelve el otro mensaje solo después de que termine la condición.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"hasHonors\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"grade\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (grade &gt;= \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;With honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Without honors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hasHonors(\" /><text value=\"98\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return &quot;No honors&quot;;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"With honors\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return \"With honors\";</code> seguido de <code>return \"Without honors\";</code> y finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
